full_article:
Nepal's Ambassador to Bangladesh Ghanashyam Bhandari today (16 August) discussed the evolution of Nepal's foreign policy and the country's relations with Bangladesh with participants of two diplomatic training programmes at the Foreign Service Academy in Dhaka.

He delivered a lecture titled "Evolution of Nepal's Foreign Policy and Perspectives on Nepal-Bangladesh Relations" to participants of the 32nd Specialised Diplomatic Training Course (SDTC) and the 4th Professional Master's in International Relations and Diplomacy (PMIRD) programme.

The ambassador outlined the evolution of Nepal's foreign policy and its current diplomatic engagements, according to the Nepal Embassy in Dhaka.

