He also highlighted various aspects of the Nepal-Bangladesh relationship, characterised by the spirit of good neighbourliness, growing economic partnership, and excellent people-to-people ties.

The lecture was followed by an interactive question-and-answer session, during which Bhandari responded to participants' questions.

